---
kind: scene
id: road.tunnel
title: Under the millrace
on: explore
target: place.tunnel
after: 'visited("road.ford")'
when: "holds(knows(passage)) && quest.hostages.state == 'active'"
priority: 10
components: [../../components/reaction.component.lute]
---

## The Smugglers' Cut

::bg{location="mill_tunnel" time="night"}
::music{action="change" mood="tense" volume="down"}
@narrator: The cut runs under the river, brick-lined and sweating. Two Duskbound sit at a plank table with a lantern and a pot of something that was once a stew. Behind them, a door with a bar across it.
@narrator: One of the guards is barely older than the twins.

<branch id="tunnel" prompt="The guards haven't seen you yet.">
  <choice id="talk" label="[Persuasion] Step into the light, hands open." when="holds(inParty(isolde)) && run.approval.isolde >= 1">
    @isolde: Isolde Vane, of no company now. Put the crossbow down, lad. Nobody here is getting paid enough to die.
    ::check{skill="persuasion" dc="12" resultKey="guards" sync="true"}
    <match on="scene.check.guards.passed">
      <when is="true">
        @narrator: The boy looks at the older guard. The older guard looks at Isolde's sword, and at the door, and at his stew. He puts the crossbow down.
        ::use{component="reaction" who="isolde" feel="approves"}
        ::set{run.rep.dusk += 1}
      </when>
      <when is="false">
        @narrator: The boy's crossbow goes off. The bolt takes Isolde's pauldron and spins her halfway round. After that it is short and loud.
        ::set{run.rep.dusk -= 1}
      </when>
    </match>
  </choice>
  <choice id="river" label="Let Wren call the river in." when="@wrenWithUs">
    @wren: Hold your breath. Not you. Them.
    @narrator: The sacking dam upstream gives with a sound like a sigh. Water comes down the cut ankle-deep, then knee-deep, then the lantern is out and the guards are shouting and running for the far end.
    ::use{component="reaction" who="wren" feel="adores"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="knife" label="Signal Corvin. Quietly." when="holds(inParty(corvin))">
    @narrator: Corvin is behind the older guard before the stew spoon reaches his mouth. The boy runs. Nobody chases him.
    @corvin: He'll tell Maelis. Good. Let her count what she's lost.
    ::use{component="reaction" who="corvin" feel="approves"}
    ::use{component="reaction" who="isolde" feel="disapproves"}
    ::set{run.rep.dusk -= 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="rush" label="Rush them.">
    @narrator: It is short and loud and nobody who matters dies. The boy has a cut over his eye he'll brag about for years.
    ::set{run.rep.dusk -= 1}
  </choice>
</branch>

@narrator: Behind the barred door: two children, filthy, furious, and alive. Hanne has bitten someone. She is very proud of it.
::set{run.hostagesFreed = true}
@wren{when="@wrenWithUs"}: Come on, little fish. Your mother is going to shout at everybody.
